TEXT 0 -288 Left 2 ;Lab A part 4 - voice coil driving two masses. Electrical loop (left) + mechanical MOBILITY network (right)
TEXT 0 -256 Left 2 ;coupling: E_emf = Bl*u_c opposes the drive (back-EMF), F_Bl injects the Lorentz force f = Bl*i = 1.5*I(Vs1) into node u_c
TEXT 0 240 Left 2 !.param Rc=0.5 Le=10u Bl=1.5 Mmc=5m Cms=1e-5 Rms=1 Mm1=100m Cms2=1e-2 Rms2=0.1
TEXT 0 280 Left 2 !.ac dec 200 1 10k
TEXT 0 330 Left 2 ;4a: V(u_c) V(u_1) [m/s per V].  4b: Z_M = Bl*i/u_c = 1.5*I(Vs1)/V(u_c).  4c: Z_E = V(vin)/I(Vs1)
TEXT 0 362 Left 2 ;sign check: the 4.9 Hz peak of V(u_c) must be SMALL (0.65). If it is ~30, the back-EMF has the wrong sign.
